From a743538a7bb6c35ff0c22ae58cf629f63852ccf6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 01:27:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] qt/apt/dist: Discord setting, AppletUtility names, Tangelo
 icon file names

- Network settings: the Discord checkbox was loaded under ENABLE_DISCORD_RPC
  (never defined) but saved under USE_DISCORD_PRESENCE, so it always
  showed unticked. Both now use USE_DISCORD_PRESENCE.
- APT AppletUtility: the commands documented on 3dbrew (ClearPowerButtonState,
  SleepIfShellClosed, LockTransition, TryLockTransition, UnlockTransition,
  StartExitTask, ...) are logged by name at debug level instead of as a
  stub warning around every applet launch. They need no emulation (the
  lid is never closed, there is no transition locking). Unknown commands
  still warn. Behaviour is unchanged.
- The icon and manifest files already contain the Tangelo artwork; rename
  azahar.ico / azahar.manifest / apple/azahar.icns to tangelo.* and update
  the .rc files, the NSIS installer and the macOS bundle settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
